                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/24479: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Summerlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-08-19T12:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic">August 19,
                                1920—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received August 20—7:50
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>370. Acting Secretary of Foreign Affairs made public today a statement that Mr.
                    Iglesias is not authorized to receive conditions referred to in my telegram 366,
                    August 17, noon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
